        "https://geoscience.data.qld.gov.au/dataset/ds000004"
      ],
      "brief": "Tyrconnel (GSQ site 43836, 3.0 km ene of thornborough) is recorded by the Geological Survey of Queensland as abandoned mine, gold size band small, 0.5 - 5 t. Reported production: 1,819.3 kg gold, about 58,492 oz troy (converted here; the survey records 1,819.3 kg) (to 1988, Tyrconnel, per GSQ MINOCC 2017 (Total_Ores_Prod, SITE_NO 43836)); 50,888 tonnes ore (to 1988, Tyrconnel, per GSQ MINOCC 2017"
